-- V19: snapshot of local FAQ and guide test content, 2026-11-05.
-- No passwords, user progress, chats or personal account data are exported.
-- Existing matching guides/FAQs are kept; generated IDs are resolved on the destination.
-- Images are bundled under dev/guide-media and restored by DevDataSeeder (local profile).
-- As a Flyway migration this SQL runs on ALL profiles once. Do not edit after sharing.
-- Unrelated local place/blog links are omitted rather than reusing foreign IDs.
